{"unit_id":"HERO476__dsh-instruction-memory#card-zh","repo":"HERO476/dsh-instruction-memory","commit":"74fab838f5a68c490d755f0b5d3993d60a879625","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Instruction Memory 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的长期指令记忆插件。它在设置界面提供指令管理页，并将用户维护的内容注册为系统提示词段落，在后续对话中自动注入。用户可以管理始终生效或按需使用的指令，按优先级和字数预算组织内容，并维护多个配置集及用户形象。设置页还支持查看与恢复历史版本、导入导出和本机备份。适合希望为不同会话保留稳定偏好、背景信息或工作规则的 DSH 用户。核心记忆无需 API 密钥；可选反馈邮件需自行配置 SMTP。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:2144","lib/client.js:3990","lib/index.js:704"]}
{"unit_id":"HERO476__dsh-instruction-memory#card-en","repo":"HERO476/dsh-instruction-memory","commit":"74fab838f5a68c490d755f0b5d3993d60a879625","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"DSH Instruction Memory adds a settings page for reusable instructions. Enabled entries join later DSH system prompts; users can set priorities, group instructions into sets and profiles, and restore or export saved data. Core memory needs no API key.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:2144","lib/client.js:3990","lib/index.js:704"]}
